{
    "title": "MLB 9 Innings 24",
    "description": "MLB 9 Innings 24, A baseball game in the palm of your hands!\r\nMike Trout's favorite baseball game!\r\n\r\nMLB 9 Innings 24, a mobile baseball game officially licensed by MLB!\r\n\r\n\u25c8 MLB 9 Innings 24 Features \u25c8\r\n# Meet some of the greatest players in MLB history!\r\nRickey Henderson, Warren Spahn, Ivan Rodriguez, Roy Halladay, Sammy Sosa\r\nMake your dreams come true by meeting the true baseball legends!\r\n\r\n# Enjoy A Major League Baseball Game on mobile\r\n- All the latest data from the 2024 season. Team logo, uniforms and ball parks implemented\r\n- Approximately 2,000 MLB star players implemented in realistic, full 3D graphics\r\n- Approximately 600 different types of hitting & pitching forms implemented\r\nEnjoy the 2024 MLB season in 9 Innings 24.\r\n\r\n#Ghost Runner Rule\r\nSay goodbye to boring overtime innings.\r\nPlay a thrilling baseball game with Ghost Runner Rule when the score is tied until the bottom of the ninth\r\ninning in league mode in 9 Innings.\r\n\r\n#Perfectly Implemented MLB City Connect Uniforms\r\nCheck out the new City Connect uniforms in 9 Innings.\r\nSee your players entering the ballpark in City Connect uniforms and playing epic baseball games.\r\n\r\n#Stage Challenge Mode\r\nAchieve higher stages in challenge mode for better rewards.\r\n\r\n#Bring Out the Potential of Players\r\nFollow the development of Major League players through a variety of training content.\r\n\r\n#Watch Your Players Hitting Home Runs Through Dynamic Camera Angles\r\nPlay realistic Major League Baseball games from different views and see fantastic home runs.\r\n\r\n# Power Ranking & Club Power Ranking Tournaments\r\nCompete against top players to reach the top in MLB 9 Innings 24.\r\nEnjoy cumulative success rewards through Pick'em in the Power Ranking Tournament.s 24, a mobile baseball\r\ngame officially licensed by MLB!\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of MLB Players, Inc.\r\nMLB Players, Inc. trademarks, copyrighted works, and other intellectual property rights are owned and/or held by MLB Players, Inc. and may not be used without the written consent of MLB Players, Inc.\r\nVisit www.MLBPLAYERS.com and check the Players Choice.\r\n\r\n* Access permission notice for gameplay\r\n\u00b7 Push Notification: The authority is required to receive push notifications from the game.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Removing Access Permission\r\nYou can change or remove access permissions through the following method.\r\n\r\n[OS above 6.0]\r\nSettings > Application > MLB 9 Innings App > Permissions > Agree or deny access permission\r\n\r\n[OS below 6.0]\r\nUpdate your OS to remove access permission or delete the app\r\n\r\n\u203b You'll be able to enjoy the service except features related to above authorities even if you don't give permission to the above.\r\n\r\nConsumer Information:\r\n\u2022 Language support: \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, English, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \u4e2d\u6587\u7b80\u4f53, \u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4, Espa\u00f1ol.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Items are available for purchase in this game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item. \r\n\u2022 For Com2uS Mobile Game Terms of Service, visit http://www.withhive.com/.\r\n- Terms of Service : http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T1\r\n- Privacy Policy : http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T3\r\n\u2022 For questions or customer support, please contact our Customer Support by visiting http://www.withhive.com/help/inquire",
    "descriptionHTML": "MLB 9 Innings 24, A baseball game in the palm of your hands!<br>Mike Trout&#39;s favorite baseball game!<br><br>MLB 9 Innings 24, a mobile baseball game officially licensed by MLB!<br><br>\u25c8 MLB 9 Innings 24 Features \u25c8<br># Meet some of the greatest players in MLB history!<br>Rickey Henderson, Warren Spahn, Ivan Rodriguez, Roy Halladay, Sammy Sosa<br>Make your dreams come true by meeting the true baseball legends!<br><br># Enjoy A Major League Baseball Game on mobile<br>- All the latest data from the 2024 season. Team logo, uniforms and ball parks implemented<br>- Approximately 2,000 MLB star players implemented in realistic, full 3D graphics<br>- Approximately 600 different types of hitting &amp; pitching forms implemented<br>Enjoy the 2024 MLB season in 9 Innings 24.<br><br>#Ghost Runner Rule<br>Say goodbye to boring overtime innings.<br>Play a thrilling baseball game with Ghost Runner Rule when the score is tied until the bottom of the ninth<br>inning in league mode in 9 Innings.<br><br>#Perfectly Implemented MLB City Connect Uniforms<br>Check out the new City Connect uniforms in 9 Innings.<br>See your players entering the ballpark in City Connect uniforms and playing epic baseball games.<br><br>#Stage Challenge Mode<br>Achieve higher stages in challenge mode for better rewards.<br><br>#Bring Out the Potential of Players<br>Follow the development of Major League players through a variety of training content.<br><br>#Watch Your Players Hitting Home Runs Through Dynamic Camera Angles<br>Play realistic Major League Baseball games from different views and see fantastic home runs.<br><br># Power Ranking &amp; Club Power Ranking Tournaments<br>Compete against top players to reach the top in MLB 9 Innings 24.<br>Enjoy cumulative success rewards through Pick&#39;em in the Power Ranking Tournament.s 24, a mobile baseball<br>game officially licensed by MLB!<br><br>Officially Licensed Product of MLB Players, Inc.<br>MLB Players, Inc. trademarks, copyrighted works, and other intellectual property rights are owned and/or held by MLB Players, Inc. and may not be used without the written consent of MLB Players, Inc.<br>Visit www.MLBPLAYERS.com and check the Players Choice.<br><br>* Access permission notice for gameplay<br>\u00b7 Push Notification: The authority is required to receive push notifications from the game.<br><br>\u25b6Removing Access Permission<br>You can change or remove access permissions through the following method.<br><br>[OS above 6.0]<br>Settings &gt; Application &gt; MLB 9 Innings App &gt; Permissions &gt; Agree or deny access permission<br><br>[OS below 6.0]<br>Update your OS to remove access permission or delete the app<br><br>\u203b You&#39;ll be able to enjoy the service except features related to above authorities even if you don&#39;t give permission to the above.<br><br>Consumer Information:<br>\u2022 Language support: \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, English, \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \u4e2d\u6587\u7b80\u4f53, \u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4, Espa\u00f1ol.<br><br>\u2022 Items are available for purchase in this game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item. <br>\u2022 For Com2uS Mobile Game Terms of Service, visit http://www.withhive.com/.<br>- Terms of Service : http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T1<br>- Privacy Policy : http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T3<br>\u2022 For questions or customer support, please contact our Customer Support by visiting http://www.withhive.com/help/inquire",
